{"_header": true, "version": "conv-1", "rules": "The conversation bank (H6 pass 5, Ahmed 15 Nov 2026): multi-turn conversations, each guest message with its expected outcome — reply (small talk), answer, ask, quote, clarify, redirect, handoff or none (no reply). Never a draft, never silence (unless none is allowed), never «لم أعرف الإجابة» for small talk, a clarifying question or a redirect. A message «[button:<id>]» is a tap on our own quick reply. Graded by code (grade.ts gradeConversation) and, in the bank runs, for naturalness by a cheap model grader. Must pass before any hub deploy (DECISIONS.md 2026-11-15)."}
